      "passageTitle": "Questions 116-119 refer to the following Advertisement.",
      "passageHtml": "<div class=\"erq-doc-body\"><p><strong>Introducing the Caldoré Pro Coffee Maker</strong></p><p>Mornings just got better. The all-new Caldoré Pro brews barista-quality coffee in under two minutes, <mark class=\"erq-blank\">[116]</mark> you precious time without sacrificing flavor. Its precision temperature control ensures that every cup is extracted at the ideal heat.</p><p>Unlike ordinary machines, the Caldoré Pro features a self-cleaning function. <mark class=\"erq-blank\">[117]</mark> As a result, maintenance has never been simpler. The sleek stainless-steel design also <mark class=\"erq-blank\">[118]</mark> beautiful on any kitchen counter.</p><p>For a limited time, the Caldoré Pro is available at participating retailers nationwide. Customers who purchase before July 15 will receive a complimentary set of reusable filters, <mark class=\"erq-blank\">[119]</mark> valued at $35. Don’t miss this chance to upgrade your daily routine.</p></div>",
